## Quick Start for AI Development

This project was bootstrapped and is ready for AI-assisted development. Follow these steps in order.

## Step 1: Review Constitution

Open and read `docs/constitution.md` to understand the project principles and guidelines.

```
Run: /constitution
Paste: contents of docs/constitution.md
```

## Step 2: Review Specification

Open and read `docs/spec.md` to understand what needs to be built.

```
Run: /specify
Paste: contents of docs/spec.md
```

## Step 3: Clarify Ambiguities

Identify any unclear requirements and resolve them.

```
Run: /clarify
```

The agent will ask questions about any ambiguous parts of the spec. Answer them to complete the specification.

## Step 4: Review Implementation Plan

Open and read `docs/plan.md` to understand the technical approach.

```
Run: /plan
Paste: contents of docs/plan.md
```

## Step 5: Generate Tasks

Generate a detailed task breakdown.

```
Run: /tasks
```

This will populate `docs/tasks.md` with numbered, ordered tasks.

## Step 6: Implement

Execute the tasks and build the application.

```
Run: /implement
```

The agent will work through each task systematically, following TDD principles.

